{"t":"say","text":"Here is a 7-speed bicycle, built from its rolling chassis to the gear mechanism."}
{"t":"assembly","id":"seven-speed-bike","title":"7-speed bicycle","systems":[{"id":"wheels","label":"Wheels","summary":"Two spoked wheels support the bicycle, while pneumatic tyres provide grip and cushioning.","explode":[0,-0.3,0],"color":"#7f8a96"},{"id":"frame","label":"Frame and fork","summary":"A triangulated frame carries pedalling and road loads efficiently. The fork locates the front wheel while allowing it to steer.","explode":[0,0.35,0],"color":"#d4bf98"},{"id":"drivetrain","label":"7-speed drivetrain","summary":"The cranks drive a single front chainring connected to seven rear sprockets. A derailleur moves the chain sideways to select different ratios and keeps it tensioned.","explode":[0,0,-0.35],"color":"#e9a066"},{"id":"steering","label":"Steering and controls","summary":"The handlebar turns the fork through the stem and headset. A right-hand shifter indexes the rear derailleur across seven positions.","explode":[0.25,0.25,0.3],"color":"#c6e3ef"},{"id":"brakes","label":"Brakes","summary":"Handlebar levers pull cables that close rim-brake arms onto each wheel rim, converting motion into heat.","explode":[0,0,0.4],"color":"#cfa7c9"},{"id":"rider-support","label":"Saddle and pedals","summary":"The saddle supports the rider while two pedals transmit alternating leg force into the cranks.","explode":[-0.3,0.25,0],"color":"#9fbf8a"}]}
